":"2121353946925346862","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2121353946925346862"}},{"title":"奥特曼：机器人先用来给OpenAI建数据中心","summary":"据 Unusual Whales 转述，OpenAI CEO奥特曼说，机器人项目会先对准自家数据中心建设，说自我复制的数据中心“已在可及范围”。","post":{"id":"2121664710743597410","url":"https://x.com/unusual_whales/status/2121664710743597410","author":"unusual_whales","author_name":"unusual_whales","created_at":"2026-11-15T02:01+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":184049,"likes":480,"reposts":50,"replies":133},"flag":"媒体报道","story":{"id":"2121691715010806143","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2121691715010806143"}}]},{"id":"ai_money","name":"AI 赚钱思路/副业案例","icon":"💡","items":[{"title":"新工具 Reason：写代码费用最多省20倍","summary":"发帖人推出叫 Reason 的工具，说写代码水平接近顶级，每个任务成本低到约二十分之一。这是厂商自己的说法，没有第三方核实。","post":{"id":"2121265353867284498","url":"https://x.com/xadisingh/status/2121265353867284498","author":"xadisingh","author_name":"Adi Singh","created_at":"2026-11-13T23:34+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":3255224,"likes":2120,"reposts":513,"replies":1152},"flag":"厂商宣称","story":{"id":"2121400676047839508","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2121400676047839508"}},{"title":"11周做99次发布，赚110万美元","summary":"一家公司说，11周做了99次产品发布，帮客户拿到4671个演示，收入110万美元，现在把整套做法开源，还说团队一半是Grok Bot智能体。收入是公司自己说的。","post":{"id":"2121342633406570980","url":"https://x.com/notmiramurati/status/2121342633406570980","author":"notmiramurati","author_name":"Ted","created_at":"2026-11-14T04:41+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":184624,"likes":837,"reposts":104,"replies":321},"flag":"公司自述","story":{"id":"2121431235847434248","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2121431235847434248"}},{"title":"Coinbase老板：14天自己合并46个代码提交","summary":"Coinbase CEO阿姆斯特朗说，AI让创始人能更多亲自动手，他14天自己合并了46个代码改动。这是他本人的说法。","post":{"id":"2121370656310763551","url":"https://x.com/brian_armstrong/status/2121370656310763551","author":"brian_armstrong","author_name":"Brian Armstrong","created_at":"2026-11-14T06:32+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":114648,"likes":1160,"reposts":67,"replies":211},"flag":"本人说法"}]},{"id":"grok","name":"Grok Bot 使用小技巧","icon":"🛠️","items":[{"title":"Grok Bot现在能进视频会议帮忙","summary":"官方说，Grok Bot可以加入会议：你可以向它提问、给它派活，或让它记下团队做了什么决定。具体支持哪些会议软件，请点原帖看。","post":{"id":"2121320089920430181","url":"https://x.com/bot/status/2121320089920430181","author":"bot","author_name":"Grok Bot","created_at":"2026-11-14T03:11+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":2557259,"likes":6628,"reposts":482,"replies":727},"flag":"公司自述","story":{"id":"2121562124446994576","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2121562124446994576"}},{"title":"马斯克：Grok Bot更省额度了","summary":"马斯克转发官方说明：本周优化后，同样套餐大约能多用7%额度，常规任务最多多用约15%。这是官方说法。","post":{"id":"2121628295234023654","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2121628295234023654","author":"elonmusk","author_name":"Elon Musk","created_at":"2026-11-14T23:36+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":1641659,"likes":7221,"reposts":605,"replies":959},"flag":"公司自述","story":{"id":"2121632801263169581","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2121632801263169581"}},{"title":"用户分享：Grok Bot像一个专家团队","summary":"有用户说Grok Bot像一支专家团队，可定制，能代替搜索，也能增强客户管理（CRM）这类软件，各设备都能用。这是个人使用感受。","post":{"id":"2121661606824419580","url":"https://x.com/adeoressi/status/2121661606824419580","author":"adeoressi","author_name":"Adeo Ressi","created_at":"2026-11-15T01:48+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":308196,"likes":1163,"reposts":142,"replies":92},"flag":"个人分享"},{"title":"提示：别总叫AI“改最小最快”","summary":"一位工程师提醒：总让AI写“最小改动、最快办法”，AI可能用拼凑办法，下一个AI还会照着抄，问题越传越多。能照着做：给AI讲清想要的长久做法。","post":{"id":"2121646643124809848","url":"https://x.com/poteto/status/2121646643124809848","author":"poteto","author_name":"lauren","created_at":"2026-11-15T00:49+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":98902,"likes":2528,"reposts":109,"replies":208},"flag":"观点"}]},{"id":"self_up","name":"AI 时代怎么提升自己","icon":"📚","items":[{"title":"老板吐槽：律所费用一年上千万美元，AI能省吗","summary":"一位企业主说公司每年法律费用超1000万美元，多数花在相似的并购文件上，他想知道AI能不能省。他也说据他了解AI还不够好。这是个人看法。","post":{"id":"2121583367841796280","url":"https://x.com/BigJohn043/status/2121583367841796280","author":"BigJohn043","author_name":"John Caple","created_at":"2026-11-14T20:37+08:00"},"met